From contact@home56.top Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 23:20:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] init: integrate fixed Floral FUSE boot views
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Consume the none/lxcfs/lupine boot contract and verify the host-installed
views before services start. Keep the instance control mounts private and
leave normal device-node handling intact. Do not relabel read-only sysfs.

Requires runtime_floral_fuse and the existing patches through 0014.

Base-tree: 5017b3eabf9c9f0b7688229b4240689e570cc036
Result-tree: 2883e713153311e407de69f4678b4960bb2a6532
